    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tethers? there's nothing left to tether to. every last person who knew me, every connection i had, it was all tied to that digital presence. now that it's gone, there's literally no social footprint left of me. i'm just a blank space. it's like the universe realized i was an error and just... corrected it. i don't see the point in trying to rebuild when the person everyone actually cared about is already dead.",
